{"id": "unknown-2026-10-16-003", "date": "2026-10-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "positive", "score": 0.5, "keywords": ["improve"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Raontech and SN Display to develop perovskite QD color conversion for OLED microdisplays", "content": "<p>Korea's Raontech announced that it has signed an MoU with SN Display to co-develop perovskite-based next-generation AR/VR microdisplays. The two companies are already conducting preliminary research in which SN Display's perovskite technology is applied to Raontech's OLED microdisplay samples, in order to verify the performance improvements and potential applications.</p><p><img class=\"align-center\" src=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/mcp-uploads/Raontech-SN-Display-MoU-2026-10", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/raontech-and-sn-display-develop-perovskite-color-conversion-micro-oled", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "samsung_elec-2026-10-16-004", "date": "2026-10-16", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q4", "month": 10, "week": 42, "weekday": "Fri"}, "entities": {"companies": ["samsung_elec"], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["oled_penetration"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "Samsung supplies over 70% of the OLED panels used by major laptop brands, PC makers turn to Chinese suppliers", "content": "<p>According to a new report from Chinese market research firm Sigmaintell, Samsung Display supplies more than 70% of the OLED panels used by the major laptop brands. As supply becomes increasingly concentrated, PC makers are starting to approach Chinese OLED makers as alternative suppliers, both to secure panel volumes and to strengthen their bargaining power on prices.</p><a href=\"https://www.oled-info.com/sites/default/files/mcp-uploads/Laptop-OLED-penetration-by-brand-2025-2026.png\"><img cla", "sources": [{"name": "oled_info", "url": "https://www.oled-info.com/sigmaintell-samsung-display-supplies-over-70-oled-panels-used-major-laptop", "type": "rss"}]}
